# 0332 = 0331 + composite/BOS/MS OS 2.0 code, GATED by rubywinusb
# (default 0).  Modes: 0 off (equivalent to 0331), 1 BOS+MS OS,
# 2 BOS only (diagnostic; Windows rejects by design), 3 serve both
# descriptors but keep bcdUSB 2.00 (diagnostic read-back mode).
#
# Activation is a NEGATIVE result: Windows reports Code 43 "invalid
# configuration descriptor" for mode 1 even after the CompatibleID
# Reserved-byte fix and after adding the Device Qualifier and
# Other-Speed Configuration.  ETW (UCX) shows a repeated 9-byte
# control-IN STALL (0xC0010000).  Descriptor bytes themselves were
# verified on the device in mode 3 (BOS 40 B, MS OS 176 B clean walk).
#
# local build: kernel full af9bcdc4..., exec c9684d95...
# images: x16-0332-bos-gated.img 0bf995ba... (default)
#         x16-0332-winusb1.img   78ee0e00... (activation, Windows rejects)
#         x16-0332-winusb3.img   12d2c321... (diagnostic)
KERNEL_EXPECT_EXEC_DATA=c9684d95257380c58cb4242a19175d8e90386ced4c7df3a4656d6280731f9b2f